     "id": "8de9d7c",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>Looking at the Schnitz menu for the first time can be a little overwhelming. You pick a protein, a crumb or flavour, then decide whether you want it in a burger, a wrap, on a plate or on a salad. This guide lays the whole menu out category by category, with an approximate Australian price and calorie count wherever one is publicly available.</p><p>Use the search box to find an item fast, tap a column heading to sort by price or calories, or press <strong>+</strong> next to any item to build a meal and see the running total. Prices are typical pickup prices &#8211; delivery apps usually charge more, and some stores (airports, stadiums, CBD food courts) price higher again.</p>"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
