      "title": "How to Order at Schnitz",
      "header_size": "h2"
     },
     "elements": []
    },
    {
     "id": "8daf0b4",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<ol><li><strong>Choose your schnitzel.</strong> Chicken is the classic. Beef and plant-based schnitzels are available in most wraps and burgers.</li><li><strong>Pick a crumb or flavour.</strong> Traditional crumbs, spicy crumbs, a buttermilk breader, or a crumb-free flavour such as lemon pepper or Moroccan spices.</li><li><strong>Pick a format.</strong> Burger, wrap, plate with chips, or salad.</li><li><strong>Add sides and a drink.</strong> Chips, sweet potato chips, slaw, dips and soft drinks.</li></ol>"
     },
     "elements": []
